<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ITT started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ITT started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said analyst John Rohs initiated coverage of ITT Corp with a perform-in-line rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $2.08 per share in 1996, $2.15 in 1997, and $2.85 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price targert of $43. Shares fell 1/4 to 41-1/2.</p>
</text>
